    "sentence_translations": [
      "Work Hours",
      "",
      "Little He: Sigh… We have to work overtime on Saturday again.",
      "",
      "Little Zhang: Yes. Everyone else says that a programmer’s work hours are 996.",
      "I see ours also quickly getting the same as theirs.",
      "",
      "Little He: What 996?",
      "",
      "Little Zhang: It is to start working at 9 in the morning, get off work at 9 in the evening, and work 6 days a week.",
      "",
      "Little He: How can we be 996?",
      "We are 007, start work at 00:00, get off work at 00:00, work 7 days a week, and have no time to rest at all.",
      "",
      "Little Zhang: You’re not wrong. Sigh… I haven’t traveled in such a long time.",
      "I really wish I was a teacher or a civil servant, they are all 855, such happiness.",
      "",
      "Little He: 855? Oh, start work at 8 in the morning, get off work at 5 in the afternoon, work 5 days a week, right?",
      "",
      "Little Zhang: That’s right! Think about it, how long is it already since we got off work at 5?",
      "",
      "Little He: Forget it! Don’t think about it, let’s get to work without losing time!",
      "I really don’t want to always work until midnight every day.",
      ""
    ]
  }
